sequenceDiagram
    actor D as Developer
    participant W as GitHub Actions
    participant A as EKS API
    participant O as k6 Operator
    participant J as Kubernetes Job controller
    participant K as k6 pods
    participant B as Prepared Bookinfo
    D->>W: Request target, total VUs, duration, runners
    W->>W: Validate request and allowed source
    W->>A: Check namespace controls#59; create run script
    W->>A: Create namespaced TestRun
    A-->>O: k6 Operator observes TestRun
    O->>A: Create initializer, runner, starter Jobs and helper Services
    J->>A: Create Pods for Jobs
    K->>B: GET target_url#59; status === 200
    Note over W,K: Observe runner Jobs#59; prepare available results
    W->>A: Delete TestRun, then script ConfigMap#59; verify absence
    W-->>D: Summary: execution, cleanup, available results
